---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import ButtonLink from '../components/ButtonLink.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Custom Business Software and Automation in Albany, NY"
  description="Custom business software, internal dashboards, workflow automations, client portals and integrations for small businesses in Albany, Troy and beyond."
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Custom business software · Capital Region and remote"
    title="Your business does not have to fit somebody else's software."
    description="When spreadsheets, disconnected apps or repeated manual steps slow down daily work, Calypso Digital Studio can design a focused tool around the process you actually need."
  />

  <section class="intro-cta container" aria-label="Discuss a software project">
    <ButtonLink href="/start">Discuss a Software Project</ButtonLink>
    <ButtonLink href="/work#project-nugnav" variant="secondary">See a Custom Application</ButtonLink>
  </section>

  <section class="solutions container" aria-labelledby="solutions-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we can build</p>
    <h2 id="solutions-title">Practical tools, not unnecessary complexity.</h2>
    <div class="solution-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Internal dashboards</h3><p>Bring important business information together so your team can track requests, work, or performance without searching through several systems.</p><p class="examples">Job tracking · Reporting · Operational views</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Customer and staff portals</h3><p>Give the right people a focused place to submit information, check progress, or manage an ongoing process.</p><p class="examples">Client intake · Status tracking · Secure access</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Custom calculators and databases</h3><p>Replace error-prone spreadsheets or repetitive calculations with a purpose-built interface and organized records.</p><p class="examples">Estimate builders · Records · Searchable catalogs</p></article>
      <article id="automations"><span>04</span><h3>Automations and integrations</h3><p>Connect compatible services and automate repeatable steps such as receiving requests, transferring information, or sending follow-up notifications.</p><p class="examples">Form workflows · Notifications · API integrations</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach container surface" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">A practical approach</p>
    <h2 id="approach-title">Start with the problem, not a giant software build.</h2>
    <p>A custom application is not always the right answer. An existing service, a better form, or a small integration might solve the problem more affordably. We review what you use today, what needs to improve, and what can be delivered in a manageable first phase.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div><strong>01 · Understand</strong><p>Show the current workflow and where time or information is being lost.</p></div>
      <div><strong>02 · Define</strong><p>Agree on a specific first deliverable, integrations, access needs, and a written quote.</p></div>
      <div><strong>03 · Build</strong><p>Develop, test, and document the agreed solution, including any ongoing hosting or maintenance considerations.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof container" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">An example from our work</p>
    <h2 id="proof-title">NugNav: a data-driven web application.</h2>
    <p>NugNav is a live, evolving New York product price-comparison application. Its location-based search, structured data and comparison workflows demonstrate the type of functionality possible beyond a standard informational website.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/work#project-nugnav">Explore the NugNav case study</a>
  </section>

  <section class="contact container surface" aria-labelledby="software-contact-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Have a repetitive task or an idea for a tool?</p>
    <h2 id="software-contact-title">Describe how the work happens today.</h2>
    <p>You do not need technical specifications. A description of the problem, the people involved, and any existing tools is enough to start a conversation. Pricing is based on the agreed scope.</p>
    <ButtonLink href="/start">Request a Software Consultation</ButtonLink>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-3);padding-bottom:var(--space-7)}
  .solutions{padding-bottom:var(--space-7)}
  .solutions h2{max-width:27ch}
  .solution-grid{display:grid;gap:var(--space-5);margin-top:var(--space-6)}
  .solution-grid article{border-top:2px solid var(--color-ink);padding-top:var(--space-5);scroll-margin-top:var(--space-6)}
  .solution-grid span{color:var(--color-rust);font-weight:800}
  .solution-grid h3{margin-top:var(--space-3)}
  .examples{color:var(--color-muted);font-size:var(--step--1);font-weight:700}
  .approach{padding:var(--space-6);margin-bottom:var(--space-7)}
  .approach h2{max-width:27ch}
  .steps{display:grid;gap:var(--space-4);margin-top:var(--space-5)}
  .steps div{border-top:var(--border-thin);padding-top:var(--space-3)}
  .steps strong{font-weight:800}
  .steps p{margin-top:var(--space-2)}
  .proof{padding-block:var(--space-5) var(--space-7)}
  .contact{padding:var(--space-6);margin-bottom:var(--space-8)}
  .contact h2{max-width:27ch}
  @media(min-width:48rem){.solution-grid,.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.approach,.contact{padding:var(--space-7)}}
  @media(min-width:64rem){.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}
</style>
